{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_utage_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_utage_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鵺切的故事",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_utage_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9b32b30ad7e43fe06f64fdc75548341bd67290c1ab5bcad95123765a648c9345",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g10_easternhouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，你们听见了什么没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好像，有什么在屋顶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊该死！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是个什么玩意儿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不吉的怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶走它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不明的怪物",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（大吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你惹怒它了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奉行C",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主、主上！您怎么能来！这太危险了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大名",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这丑陋的怪物！胆敢伤我臣民，我要你用命来偿还！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodeslowerdeck"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "罗德岛对外联络处"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是东国的鵺切家的传说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，听说到现在，鵺切家也守护着东国的某个家族，帮他们驱逐恶兆，带来祥瑞呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，那也没说清楚这个城主和城池是哪家哪座啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以它才是传说啊，传说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这批货物我清点过了。老规矩，从这个走廊送过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到前面左边的拐角了吗，那个红色的标记那里就是货梯，往上两层就到可露希尔的存储间了，送到那就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "路上跟着指示走，会需要你们过三次安检，正常配合相关工作人员操作即可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是你们罗德岛麻烦，直接收了不行吗？好吧，那我在这边整理单据，你把东西送过去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可快去吧别啰里吧嗦的。可别迷路了，我来了好多次，还是会被这罗德岛的走廊搞迷糊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么最近又换了新的信使？看他像是第一次来啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这工作不就是这样，新人旧人换来换去的。路上到处都是危险，给大家传递东西有多难你们罗德岛又不是不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那之前跟你搭档的小帕克是怎么说，辞职不干了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前他自己送信的时候被野兽弄伤了，就暂时回雷姆必拓的老家休养去了。也不知道是多重的伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小命还在，那就是万幸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以这不，派来了新的伙计咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这走廊怎么看都一样啊，这......不会真迷路了吧。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，这里连个人都没有了，我是怎么绕过来的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是要去把货物送到可露希尔的存储间吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要我帮你指路吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，学生？谢谢你，你是这里的病人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只是~我也是这里的干员，要看看我的通行证吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么年轻，那可真是失礼了，能麻烦你告诉我该怎么走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题啊，只需要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，那个盒子，你怎么能随便拿啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我订的东西，我不能直接拿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你等等，这不还得走一遍你们罗德岛的检查——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我每次都是自己拿的，看看这里写的——“宴”“彩妆系列”。怎么，你担心里面有源石炸弹吗？不然我拆开给你看看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那倒不用，主要是，流程......就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看你背后，往回走到前面第三扇门再往后，二十米远的那个拐弯处，然后再右拐然后走左手边的通道，直走三十米就到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走吧快走吧，我也要去训练了，拜拜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸欸，你别——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是罗德岛的干员吗......真随性啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一会儿货送过去的时候，我也跟安检的人员说一声吧，就说这个叫宴的干员拿走了一件货物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "善谈的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赶快赶快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在信使看不到的转角处，宴并没有离开。\n小盒子被宴捧在手上，就像里面有什么重要的东西一样。\n一点声音都没有发出，宴跟在了信使背后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodeslowerdeck"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听你说了半天，所以其实是你对东国的传说故事很好奇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对啊，咱做信使的，不就图个新奇事吗。我遇到哪里的人啊，就会问他们哪里的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还真像是信使会做的事。不过，我倒是听过另一个版本的鵺切的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？你快给我讲讲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g10_easternhouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodeslowerdeck"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今，那城池早已消亡，但是听说鵺切家还暗中存在着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们被现在的某个东国大家族收入麾下，一直履行着家族的职责——斩杀掉主上眼中的“鵺”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说的就是这样的......版本了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差别如此之大，这可真有意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你们聊的话题真有趣。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "还有后续吗？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！你什么时候来的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "大名刚愎自用残忍暴虐的时候吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别别，你可别当真。我也只是道听途说，不知道这里面的真真假假，博士你可千万别信啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈故事而已，离奇一点才算是故事嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，那个新来的家伙怎么还没回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士专门过来，是因为有重要的信件要取吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "有几个办事处的报告会在今天送到。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚好这边的货物清单处理好了，我们去可露希尔那边看看吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个慢悠悠的家伙，不会真迷路了吧！我得好好数落数落那个家伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？咋回事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛货物管理员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_972_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是怎么了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是存储间那边的警报。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们赶快过去看看吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在通往可露希尔的存储间的走廊上，好几名干员已经守在此处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "发生什么事了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人触发了热能警报，很有可能是谁在此进行了涉及源石技艺的战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但现场并没有什么作战痕迹，只有一车货物在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是我们今天送来的货物吗？应该还有一位信使才对啊，人不见了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "干员摇摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士您请小心，我们正在调查监控，这段时间请跟我们待在一起，以免真的有什么危险发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（观察一下走廊的状况）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的信使",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个成年人，不至于真就这么不见了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在那车货物的一侧，博士蹲下身子，好像闻到了一丝淡淡的气味。\n那是很微小的，甜甜的气味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "难道是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（真是不省心啊......麻烦死了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这样抱怨着，宴看了眼怀里抱着的小纸盒子，上面有些摔过的痕迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不开心。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊！麻烦死了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宴一股脑地将包裹和长刀放在桌子上。\n她用做了美甲的手指挑起拆盒小刀，轻松划开了纸盒。在纸盒封口处，纸板的夹层中，一块元件露了出来。\n元件连接着小小的源石电池，看起来精密又轻巧。\n宴看着这块小元件，收起了笑容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，听得到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宴对着元件说起了话，果不其然，这是个窃听器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "36_g10_easternhouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我们在某个边缘的侧门发现了那位信使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不知道因为什么昏倒过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他肯定是操劳过度了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "将他送去休息室，让他好好缓缓吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，这......万一他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这怎么看都很蹊跷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没事，相信我，没事的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这里我都检查过了，没有什么其他人的痕迹了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......既然博士您都这样说了，那我们就先带他去休息室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "让这里的其他干员也都离开吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "并不是什么恶性事件。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我来做记录整理好了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来的话，我只说一次哦~啊，反正你们也会录下来，无所谓无所谓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的好~~喜欢我现在的生活，我好喜欢跟我的朋友们一起玩~罗德岛上一切都挺好的，比以前的老宅好多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，训练我不喜欢，所以我好~~喜欢旷掉训练的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们别以为，可以随便派间谍装成什么人来调查罗德岛，还能不被我发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不管你们谁对罗德岛好奇，但是再被我发现你们耍手段的话，我就——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去一趟，灭掉鵺切家咯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帮我向老爸老妈问声好~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宴转身，长刀出鞘。\n窃听器干净利落地裂开来，掉进了垃圾桶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！都怪刚才的假信使，居然敢还手，害得我盒子里的散粉都撒出来了一点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真该让家里的人教训他一下的，可惜窃听器已经坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真让人生气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宴不想做杀手，不想做间谍，不想承担什么家族责任。\n宴也不想训练，说实话，做个干员也挺累的。\n她只想做个女高中生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！绮良！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小宴~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这是什么？哇啊，是新到的杂志吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的，可别撇下我一个人看啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有......我才刚收到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管了不管了，我们走吧。去你的房间，让我给你试试我新买的彩妆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又、又来吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "aliases": [
        "宴"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
